  "migration": "Only the exact frozen studio-v1 catalog digest and original parameter schema are admitted; palettes are materialized and lattice booleans mapped to numeric choices. Other stale or invalid imports fail before replacement.",
  "rendering": "Real package cores and composition helpers draw transparent layers. WebGL meshes are rasterized before ordered source-over composition, 8-bit group opacity. Required p5 drawing constants are explicitly forwarded to Graphics; temporary WebGL contexts are released after composition. Spring uses explicit ticks. Raster layers generate their own sources.",
