  "corrected_during_review": [
    "Missing p5.Graphics shape constants caused malformed meshes and unclosed outlines",
    "Default bounds and guessed package-access fields in new adapters",
    "Documentation references to controls absent from the actual browser adapters",
    "Incomplete API error tables, nested scalar-array fields and JavaScript module mappings",
    "Mobile navigation overflow and API table overflow/squashing"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "24 named compositions expose 28 operations; the API reference documents all 31. This is not an arbitrary low-level operation graph.",
    "640px canvas, at most eight layers, full recomputation. No retained geometry performance guarantee.",
    "Browser validation uses Chromium with SwiftShader; no Safari/Firefox acceptance or native corpus reproduction claim.",
    "Raster techniques generate their own source rather than processing lower layers; spring is an explicit tick snapshot.",
    "Trusted local single-process Go project storage has no accounts or per-user ownership.",
    "Prompt/MCP and portable target export remain unimplemented."
